{"id":"perf_a41731d080b8d35c","title":"柏辽兹之夜","city":"苏州","venue":"苏州文化艺术中心","hall":"金鸡湖音乐厅","startTime":"2027-03-06T11:30:00.000Z","weekday":"周六","dateLabel":"03/06","timeLabel":"19:30","description":"本场柏辽兹之夜全景式呈现法国浪漫主义先驱柏辽兹的交响艺术精髓。《罗马狂欢节》序曲以炽热灵动的旋律与绚烂配器，勾勒罗马节庆的欢腾盛景。下半场《幻想交响曲》作为浪漫主义音乐的里程碑之作，以突破性的交响结构与极具画面感的管弦色彩，抒写炽热情感与奇幻想象。整场演出深度诠释柏辽兹标志性的革新精神，铺展一幅酣畅淋漓的浪漫主义交响长卷。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238967077","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-Music-Season/2088094474708008960.html","scrapedAt":"2026-08-27T12:09:09.581Z","ensemble":"苏州交响乐团","conductor":"陈燮阳","performers":["陈燮阳"],"composers":["柏辽兹"],"program":[{"composer":"柏辽兹","title":"罗马狂欢节序曲","confidence":"official","id":"program_3a0dba1496a9f732","workId":"work_eca76db3640f19a0"},{"composer":"柏辽兹","title":"幻想交响曲","opus":"Op. 14","confidence":"official","id":"program_f42a34c4868fea9e","workId":"work_736e2f116bbcc378"}],"tags":["柏辽兹"],"dataQuality":"scraped","projectId":"event_fbbaa41b5221a5c4","priceTiers":[],"sources":[{"sourceId":"suzhou-symphony-official","sourceName":"苏州交响乐团官网","sourceRecordId":"szsorch_2088094474708008960_1804332600000","sourceUrl":"https://www.szsorch.com/2026-27-Music-Season/2088094474708008960.html","ticketUrl":"https://sscac.maitix.com/h5?code=003e5MFa1SBzcM0qf7Ia11lXco3e5MFD&state=154b6a7e32bde544195712ec00058f3e#/pages-order/projectDetail/index?projectId=238967077","scrapedAt":"2026-08-27T12:09:09.581Z"}]}